            <title>0.1.9</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 16:25:19 +0100</pubDate>
            <link>https://thisweek.is</link>
            <sparkle:version>0.1.9</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.9</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>ThisWeek Desktop 0.1.9</h2>
<p>Smoother Google sign-in and clearer Ask Anything replies.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Sign out no longer leaves you stuck on Settings after you sign back in.</li>
  <li>Sign in with Google also connects Google Calendar in the same consent.</li>
  <li>Ask Anything renders bold, lists, and other markdown properly.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
