        <item>
            <title>0.1.8</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 16:10:31 +0100</pubDate>
            <link>https://thisweek.is</link>
            <sparkle:version>0.1.8</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.8</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>ThisWeek Desktop 0.1.8</h2>
<p>Offline Enhanced notes and a clearer Google Calendar reconnect path.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Prefetch generated summaries with your offline pack so Enhanced notes open offline.</li>
  <li>Google sign-in no longer overwrites Calendar permissions.</li>
  <li>Prompt to reconnect Calendar when permissions are missing.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
