        <item>
            <title>0.1.7</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 15:48:34 +0100</pubDate>
            <link>https://thisweek.is</link>
            <sparkle:version>0.1.7</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.7</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>ThisWeek Desktop 0.1.7</h2>
<p>Opening notes offline no longer shows a summary network error.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Cache Enhanced summaries when you open a note online.</li>
  <li>Reuse that cache offline instead of failing the summaries request.</li>
  <li>Generate and edit still need internet, with calm “Requires internet” copy.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
